# UBERMETROID_NAS_METADATA_IGNORES
# Safe OS & NAS metadata exclusions for Synology DSM, Unraid, and Fedora Server
# Note: Resilio Sync treats lines starting with '#' as comments, so '?recycle',
# '?snapshot', and '?SynoRecycle' use '?' wildcard to match '#' at line start.
?recycle
?snapshot
?SynoRecycle
#recycle
#snapshot
#SynoRecycle
@eaDir
@tmp
@SynoResource
@*
.SynologyWorkingDirectory
.Recycle.Bin
$RECYCLE.BIN
$Recycle.Bin
.fuse_hidden*
.Trash-*
.DS_Store
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
ehthumbs.db
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
